      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n這一區是「模型載入器」，和「文生圖（Qwen）」**一模一樣**——Qwen-Image-2.1 是生成＋編輯統一模型，\n同三個檔案兩支範本共用：\n\n- `UNETLoader` — 主模型（`qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot`，7.26 GB）\n- `CLIPLoader` — 文字編碼器（`qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot`，型別選 `qwen_image`）\n- `VAELoader` — VAE（`qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16`；編輯模式下也負責把參考圖壓成 latent）\n- `QwenImage21Cache` — 官方前綴快取，照預設 `auto` 即可\n\n缺檔案請看「⓪ 缺模型？」那張便條。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nThe same three files as the Qwen text-to-image template (Qwen-Image-2.1 is a unified\ngeneration + editing model), plus the official prefix cache. In edit mode the VAE also packs\nthe reference photo into the latent. See the \"⓪ Missing models?\" note if anything is missing."
      ],
      "title": "① 模型載入器 / Model loaders"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1800,
        460
      ],
      "size": [
        660,
        520
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 19,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 紅框兩顆就是全部要改的**\n\n- **參考照片**：點節點上傳（或把圖拖進畫布）。清楚、光線好的人像效果最好；輸出尺寸會跟著這張走。\n- **改造想法**：中文一句到三句，寫新的身分／服裝／場景／氛圍，想保留的東西（髮型、鬍子、眼鏡）也寫進去。\n\n後面那串節點會把想法連同**照片本身**交給本機的 Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic（無審查版）——它看得到圖，\n會寫出一段「保留這個人的臉與身分」的英文編輯指令，自動接進右邊的 `TextEncodeQwenImage21`；\n露骨的改造想法也照寫，不會被拒絕。\n\n---\n\n**English — the two red nodes are all you edit**\n\nUpload the reference photo (a clear portrait works best; the output follows its size) and write\nthe transformation in Chinese. The chain hands BOTH the idea and the photo to the local,\nuncensored Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic — a vision model — which writes an identity-preserving English\nedit instruction straight into `TextEncodeQwenImage21`."
      ],
      "title": "② 照片＋想法 → 編輯指令 / Photo + idea → instruction"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        2300,
        480
      ],
      "size": [
        300,
