      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 20,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 取樣參數什麼時候要動**\n\n- `steps 25`、`cfg 1`、`euler / simple` 是官方建議值。**CFG 1 時負向提示詞無效**，這是正常的。\n- 輸出尺寸由參考照片決定（編輯 latent 直接來自照片），這裡沒有尺寸欄位可調；想要別的構圖就先裁好照片。\n- 種子統一由「種子」節點控制，預設每次隨機（小幫手的英文指令也會換措辭）；同一張照片多跑幾次會有不同詮釋，想重現就把那顆節點改成 `fixed`。\n\n---\n\n**English — when to touch the sampler**\n\n`steps 25, cfg 1, euler/simple` are the official settings (at CFG 1 the negative prompt has no\neffect). The output size comes from the reference photo itself — crop the photo for a different\nframing. One shared seed node drives both the sampler and the helper; set it to `fixed` to reproduce a result."
      ],
      "title": "③ 取樣參數 / Sampler"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
