      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 輸出在哪裡看**\n\n`SaveImage` 是輸出節點。按下右上角的 **Run / Queue** 之後：\n\n1. 這張工作流會送到聯邦裡有模型、有空的 worker 執行。\n2. 跑完的圖直接顯示在 `SaveImage` 節點上。\n3. 檔案同時存進主控台的「工作」頁，隨時可以回去下載。\n\n---\n\n**English — where the output lands**\n\nPress **Run**: the job is dispatched to an idle worker that has the models, the finished image\nshows up on the `SaveImage` node, and the file is also kept under the console's Jobs page."
      ],
      "title": "④ 輸出 / Output"
    },
